// The night-lights map as a base64 PNG, 768x384, decoded in JS at runtime.
//
// It is here rather than in assets/ because the pixels have to reach GL WITHOUT the
// driver: expo-gl uploads a bundled file through a native path that this project's
// MT6762 test phone refuses (texImage2D leaves GL error 1282, INVALID_OPERATION), and
// the globe then kept the flat fallback for the whole session. Reading it back from
// disk would need expo-file-system, which the app does not depend on, so the bytes
// travel in the bundle and are decoded with the app's own PNG reader (frameSample).
// Regenerate with scripts/globe-texture.mjs after changing assets/globe/earth-night.jpg.
export const EARTH_PNG_B64 =
  '';
